&lt;p&gt;Thks for the well placed cap. This was a nice stop on the way home. traded drivers as well so I could get some shuteye. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everything that coolcat21 said is all true.

Nice little community indeed.&lt;/p&gt;

